\title{healthtrends: Generates 'Health Trends' style reports}
\description{
Produces a health trend reports based on Health Trends in England: a set of accessible HTML pages summarising public health indicators. Reports can be produced for England, its statistical regions and upper tier local authorities. It pulls indicator data from the Fingertips API, applies the project's selection and quality rules, and renders the report with Quarto.
